IMAPAccount Gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
User kvp94best@gmail.com
PassCmd "pass Mail/kvp94best@gmail.com"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore Gmail-remote
Account Gmail

MaildirStore Gmail-local
Subfolders Verbatim
Path ~/.Mail/Gmail/
Inbox ~/.Mail/Gmail/Inbox

Channel Gmail
Far :Gmail-remote:
Near :Gmail-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
SyncState *

